{"id":"cue-0-0","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":0,"source_end_seconds":1.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.9,"text":"我把这颗珠子卡在喉咙里"}
{"id":"cue-1-1900","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":1.9,"source_end_seconds":4.1,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.2,"text":"然后它要是能把这颗珠子吸出来"}
{"id":"cue-2-4100","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":4.1,"source_end_seconds":5.28,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.18,"text":"我就真的算它厉害"}
{"id":"cue-3-5280","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":5.28,"source_end_seconds":6.3,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.02,"text":"先看视频"}
{"id":"cue-4-8820","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-4-8820","source_start_seconds":8.82,"source_end_seconds":37.42,"speaking_duration_seconds":28.6,"text":"因为宝妈要咱们帮忙撤掉"}
{"id":"cue-5-37420","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-37420","source_start_seconds":37.42,"source_end_seconds":38.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.46,"text":"那花钱的坑我们来采"}
{"id":"cue-6-38880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-37420","source_start_seconds":38.88,"source_end_seconds":41,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.12,"text":"免费的赞助观众麻烦你给支持一个"}
{"id":"cue-7-41000","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-37420","source_start_seconds":41,"source_end_seconds":42.02,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.02,"text":"这个宝妈说呢"}
{"id":"cue-8-42020","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-37420","source_start_seconds":42.02,"source_end_seconds":43.76,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.74,"text":"之前他们家孩子被掖到我"}
{"id":"cue-9-43760","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-37420","source_start_seconds":43.76,"source_end_seconds":44.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.78,"text":"很害怕"}
{"id":"cue-10-44540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-5-37420","source_start_seconds":44.54,"source_end_seconds":45.94,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"很最近才长出来"}
{"id":"cue-11-45940","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-45940","source_start_seconds":45.94,"source_end_seconds":47.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"所以呢就想背一个这个东西"}
{"id":"cue-12-47880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-45940","source_start_seconds":47.88,"source_end_seconds":49.72,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.84,"text":"问问咱们这个效果到底是怎么样"}
{"id":"cue-13-49720","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-45940","source_start_seconds":49.72,"source_end_seconds":52.44,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.72,"text":"那这个东西咱们可真不能开玩笑了"}
{"id":"cue-14-52440","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-45940","source_start_seconds":52.44,"source_end_seconds":54.02,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.58,"text":"一定要严谨的帮你测一测"}
{"id":"cue-15-54020","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-45940","source_start_seconds":54.02,"source_end_seconds":55.32,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.3,"text":"如果这个过程中"}
{"id":"cue-16-55320","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-11-45940","source_start_seconds":55.32,"source_end_seconds":57.22,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.9,"text":"小温有什么疏忽的或不对的"}
{"id":"cue-17-57220","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-57220","source_start_seconds":57.22,"source_end_seconds":59.02,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.8,"text":"大家及时帮我补充和提醒"}
{"id":"cue-18-59020","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-57220","source_start_seconds":59.02,"source_end_seconds":60.5,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"打开之后就这些东西"}
{"id":"cue-19-60500","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-57220","source_start_seconds":60.5,"source_end_seconds":62.64,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.14,"text":"首先是有两个说明书跟一个贺证"}
{"id":"cue-20-62640","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-57220","source_start_seconds":62.64,"source_end_seconds":64.42,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.78,"text":"产品的资质是没问题的"}
{"id":"cue-21-64420","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-57220","source_start_seconds":64.42,"source_end_seconds":66.18,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.76,"text":"然后呢还有一个防尘袋子"}
{"id":"cue-22-66180","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-57220","source_start_seconds":66.18,"source_end_seconds":67.28,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.1,"text":"再散个气囊面罩"}
{"id":"cue-23-67280","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-67280","source_start_seconds":67.28,"source_end_seconds":68.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"这是那大中小号"}
{"id":"cue-24-68880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-67280","source_start_seconds":68.88,"source_end_seconds":70.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"小号呢是英幼人的"}
{"id":"cue-25-70480","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-67280","source_start_seconds":70.48,"source_end_seconds":71.6,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.12,"text":"这个呢是青少年的"}
{"id":"cue-26-71600","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-67280","source_start_seconds":71.6,"source_end_seconds":72.84,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.24,"text":"这个呢是成人的"}
{"id":"cue-27-72840","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-67280","source_start_seconds":72.84,"source_end_seconds":74.7,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.86,"text":"然后呢这个就是他在主体了"}
{"id":"cue-28-74700","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-74700","source_start_seconds":74.7,"source_end_seconds":76.56,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.86,"text":"他这个使用起来也是很简单"}
{"id":"cue-29-76980","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-74700","source_start_seconds":76.98,"source_end_seconds":78.46,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"这个东西呢叫压射器"}
{"id":"cue-30-78460","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-74700","source_start_seconds":78.46,"source_end_seconds":80.04,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.58,"text":"因为他这个东西负压很大"}
{"id":"cue-31-80040","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-74700","source_start_seconds":80.04,"source_end_seconds":81.96,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.92,"text":"就把它按上之后使用的时候"}
{"id":"cue-32-81960","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-74700","source_start_seconds":81.96,"source_end_seconds":82.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.94,"text":"用它伸进去"}
{"id":"cue-33-82900","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-74700","source_start_seconds":82.9,"source_end_seconds":84.04,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.14,"text":"要压住这个舌头"}
{"id":"cue-34-84040","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-84040","source_start_seconds":84.04,"source_end_seconds":85.24,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.2,"text":"这样就会更容易的"}
{"id":"cue-35-85240","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-84040","source_start_seconds":85.24,"source_end_seconds":87,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.76,"text":"把卡到嗓子的东西给它吸出来"}
{"id":"cue-36-87000","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-84040","source_start_seconds":87,"source_end_seconds":88.52,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.52,"text":"使用起来很简单"}
{"id":"cue-37-88520","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-84040","source_start_seconds":88.52,"source_end_seconds":90.3,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.78,"text":"就把这个给它插到这边"}
{"id":"cue-38-90300","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-84040","source_start_seconds":90.3,"source_end_seconds":92.24,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"然后把这个胶怀给它撕掉"}
{"id":"cue-39-92240","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-84040","source_start_seconds":92.24,"source_end_seconds":92.82,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.58,"text":"取掉之后"}
{"id":"cue-40-92820","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-92820","source_start_seconds":92.82,"source_end_seconds":94.08,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.26,"text":"这还有一个防按卡扣"}
{"id":"cue-41-94080","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-92820","source_start_seconds":94.08,"source_end_seconds":96.04,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.96,"text":"是平时防止它这个误恩的"}
{"id":"cue-42-96040","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-92820","source_start_seconds":96.04,"source_end_seconds":97.08,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"把它取下来之后"}
{"id":"cue-43-97080","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-92820","source_start_seconds":97.08,"source_end_seconds":99,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.92,"text":"一按就开始吸了"}
{"id":"cue-44-99000","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-92820","source_start_seconds":99,"source_end_seconds":101.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.34,"text":"那咱们就先测一下它的吸力"}
{"id":"cue-45-101340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-92820","source_start_seconds":101.34,"source_end_seconds":102.28,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.94,"text":"到底怎么样啊"}
{"id":"cue-46-102280","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-46-102280","source_start_seconds":102.28,"source_end_seconds":103.26,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.98,"text":"我去准备一个道具"}
{"id":"cue-47-103260","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-46-102280","source_start_seconds":103.26,"source_end_seconds":105.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.22,"text":"咱们先来吸一下这个橡胶手套试试"}
{"id":"cue-48-105480","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-46-102280","source_start_seconds":105.48,"source_end_seconds":106.8,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.32,"text":"这个还是蛮结实的"}
{"id":"cue-49-106800","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-46-102280","source_start_seconds":106.8,"source_end_seconds":107.66,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.86,"text":"也很有弹力"}
{"id":"cue-50-107660","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-46-102280","source_start_seconds":107.66,"source_end_seconds":108.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.88,"text":"已经套好了"}
{"id":"cue-51-108540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-46-102280","source_start_seconds":108.54,"source_end_seconds":109.6,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.06,"text":"来咱们试一下"}
{"id":"cue-52-111260","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-52-111260","source_start_seconds":111.26,"source_end_seconds":112.3,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"哇看看啊"}
{"id":"cue-53-112300","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-52-111260","source_start_seconds":112.3,"source_end_seconds":113.8,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.5,"text":"直接就吸到这个眼里了"}
{"id":"cue-54-113800","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-52-111260","source_start_seconds":113.8,"source_end_seconds":115.72,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.92,"text":"这个瞬间的吸力还是蛮大的"}
{"id":"cue-55-115720","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-52-111260","source_start_seconds":115.72,"source_end_seconds":117.68,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.96,"text":"再来看一下我这个电脑机箱多沉"}
{"id":"cue-56-119480","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-119480","source_start_seconds":119.48,"source_end_seconds":120.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.06,"text":"11英斤将近"}
{"id":"cue-57-120540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-119480","source_start_seconds":120.54,"source_end_seconds":121.16,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.62,"text":"咱们试试"}
{"id":"cue-58-121160","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-119480","source_start_seconds":121.16,"source_end_seconds":122.7,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.54,"text":"能不能把它吸起来"}
{"id":"cue-59-122700","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-119480","source_start_seconds":122.7,"source_end_seconds":128.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":5.78,"text":"过去"}
{"id":"cue-60-128840","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-119480","source_start_seconds":128.84,"source_end_seconds":131.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.5,"text":"这吸力确实可以啊"}
{"id":"cue-61-131340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-56-119480","source_start_seconds":131.34,"source_end_seconds":132.98,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.64,"text":"都能做单手运动了"}
{"id":"cue-62-133620","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-133620","source_start_seconds":133.62,"source_end_seconds":134.46,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.84,"text":"确实没问题"}
{"id":"cue-63-134460","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-133620","source_start_seconds":134.46,"source_end_seconds":136.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.44,"text":"吸力它确实够大"}
{"id":"cue-64-136900","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-133620","source_start_seconds":136.9,"source_end_seconds":138.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.64,"text":"但是咱们还是得模拟一下"}
{"id":"cue-65-138540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-133620","source_start_seconds":138.54,"source_end_seconds":139.62,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.08,"text":"真实的使用场景"}
{"id":"cue-66-139620","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-62-133620","source_start_seconds":139.62,"source_end_seconds":141.14,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.52,"text":"我找了一个珠子"}
{"id":"cue-67-141140","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-67-141140","source_start_seconds":141.14,"source_end_seconds":143.04,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.9,"text":"一会我给它吞到嗓子这块"}
{"id":"cue-68-143040","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-67-141140","source_start_seconds":143.04,"source_end_seconds":144.78,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.74,"text":"咱们看看它能不能给它吸出来"}
{"id":"cue-69-144780","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-67-141140","source_start_seconds":144.78,"source_end_seconds":146.98,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.2,"text":"咱们为了防止我直接把它压一下"}
{"id":"cue-70-146980","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-67-141140","source_start_seconds":146.98,"source_end_seconds":148.74,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.76,"text":"我弄个绳给它刷了一下"}
{"id":"cue-71-148740","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-67-141140","source_start_seconds":148.74,"source_end_seconds":149.82,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.08,"text":"危险动作"}
{"id":"cue-72-149820","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-67-141140","source_start_seconds":149.82,"source_end_seconds":150.5,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.68,"text":"请勿模仿"}
{"id":"cue-73-154550","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-73-154550","source_start_seconds":154.55,"source_end_seconds":156.49,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"这玩意我等点水"}
{"id":"cue-74-156490","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-73-154550","source_start_seconds":156.49,"source_end_seconds":158.17,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.68,"text":"不搁水肯定是咽不下去"}
{"id":"cue-75-188350","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-188350","source_start_seconds":188.35,"source_end_seconds":189.27,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.92,"text":"你说他说话"}
{"id":"cue-76-189270","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-188350","source_start_seconds":189.27,"source_end_seconds":191.07,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.8,"text":"我觉得你嘴都死了"}
{"id":"cue-77-191070","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-188350","source_start_seconds":191.07,"source_end_seconds":193.07,"speaking_duration_seconds":2,"text":"哎呦天"}
{"id":"cue-78-195390","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-78-195390","source_start_seconds":195.39,"source_end_seconds":197.31,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.92,"text":"确实感觉它不是它就弹出来了"}
{"id":"cue-79-198170","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-79-198170","source_start_seconds":198.17,"source_end_seconds":200.53,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.36,"text":"但是这个东西卡到嗓子这个位置"}
{"id":"cue-80-200530","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-79-198170","source_start_seconds":200.53,"source_end_seconds":202.13,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"确实是相当的难受了"}
{"id":"cue-81-202130","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-79-198170","source_start_seconds":202.13,"source_end_seconds":203.49,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.36,"text":"那经过咱们试试"}
{"id":"cue-82-203490","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-82-203490","source_start_seconds":203.49,"source_end_seconds":205.09,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"这个烟红布负压吸引器"}
{"id":"cue-83-205090","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-82-203490","source_start_seconds":205.09,"source_end_seconds":206.07,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.98,"text":"也叫防烟仪"}
{"id":"cue-84-206070","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-82-203490","source_start_seconds":206.07,"source_end_seconds":208.05,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.98,"text":"无论是使用效果还是这个吸力"}
{"id":"cue-85-208050","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-82-203490","source_start_seconds":208.05,"source_end_seconds":209.45,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"确实都挺不错的"}
{"id":"cue-86-209450","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-82-203490","source_start_seconds":209.45,"source_end_seconds":210.67,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.22,"text":"如果你有这方面担用的"}
{"id":"cue-87-210670","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-87-210670","source_start_seconds":210.67,"source_end_seconds":211.81,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.14,"text":"确实可以背一个"}
{"id":"cue-88-211810","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-87-210670","source_start_seconds":211.81,"source_end_seconds":213.65,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.84,"text":"但是小温在这里真希望大家"}
{"id":"cue-89-213650","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-87-210670","source_start_seconds":213.65,"source_end_seconds":214.95,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.3,"text":"永远永远永远"}
{"id":"cue-90-214950","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-87-210670","source_start_seconds":214.95,"source_end_seconds":215.99,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"用不上这个东西"}
{"id":"cue-91-215990","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-87-210670","source_start_seconds":215.99,"source_end_seconds":217.31,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.32,"text":"大家根据自己的情况"}
{"id":"cue-92-217310","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-87-210670","source_start_seconds":217.31,"source_end_seconds":218.05,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.74,"text":"诛请考虑"}
